Module Name: Contract
Feature: Contract

Sale > Order > Contract Menu
Sale > Reporting > Contract Menu
Adding Contract Field to Sale Order and Operations
1. Contract
Display a list view of all contracts.
Create contracts with customers, specifying the amount and price for each product.
Link contracts to multiple companies, and view related companies in a tree view.
Track the number of open sale orders for each confirmed contract.
Contracts are manually closed once all quantities are sold.
2. Reporting Contract
View graphs, pivot tables, and list views to track sales results and contract metrics.
3. Sale Quotation/Order Form
Select a contract when placing an order (the selected company will appear in the contract).
Automatically add sale order lines based on the "quantity to sell" in the contract.
Continue the normal sales order process.
Order products with the desired quantity from the contract and update the contract with the details.
View the related contract name for any sale orders linked to the contract.
When selecting a contract, clear the fields in the sale order and populate them with contract data.
